      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Concept variations\n\n**Just looking?** Run it. The image appears in **Preview Image** and nothing is sent anywhere until\nthe Publish node has a **project** and a **link**. To iterate freely, select the Publish node and\npress **Ctrl-B** to mute it.\n\n**Ready to keep one?** Pick a project and a link on the Publish node, then Run.\n\nThe Version carries what made it — **prompt, seed, model, sampler, steps, cfg** — read off the graph\nrather than typed in. An art director reviewing in Flow PT can see how a frame was made, and you can\nmake it again.\n\nChange the **seed** and Run again: the next one is **v002** on the same stream, so variations line\nup as versions of one idea instead of loose files.\n\nFlux schnell: 4 steps, cfg 1.0, no negative prompt."
      ]
    },
